1343
00:58:24.990 --> 00:58:26.320
but what is it, like that,

1344
00:58:26.320 --> 00:58:30.380
why does that blueprint resonate so deeply

1345
00:58:30.380 --> 00:58:33.700
in an unconscious way?

1346
00:58:33.700 --> 00:58:37.860
Like, we understand it, we gravitate towards it.

1347
00:58:37.860 --> 00:58:39.910
We know it works in terms of storytelling

1348
00:58:39.910 --> 00:58:40.890
whether you're writing a novel

1349
00:58:40.890 --> 00:58:43.050
or a screenplay or a short story,

1350
00:58:43.050 --> 00:58:46.560
but it's interesting to try to ponder

1351
00:58:46.560 --> 00:58:48.100
