1352
00:58:48.100 --> 00:58:50.510
Like, is it just bred into our DNA

1353
00:58:50.510 --> 00:58:54.830
as we evolved over the millennia?

1354
00:58:54.830 --> 00:58:55.663
That's what I think.

1355
00:58:55.663 --> 00:58:56.570
I think it is.

1356
00:58:56.570 --> 00:58:59.050
I think over the millennia from going there,

1357
00:58:59.050 --> 00:59:01.760
from hominids to cave men

1358
00:59:01.760 --> 00:59:04.370
and tribal things that life just sort

1359
00:59:04.370 --> 00:59:06.380
of works in a certain way, right?

1360
00:59:06.380 --> 00:59:09.435
And I do think it's software that we're born with,

1361
00:59:09.435 --> 00:59:11.070
that that model,

1362
00:59:11.070 --> 00:59:14.620
the hero's journey is encoded in whatever,

1363
00:59:14.620 --> 00:59:17.563
in our DNA, like along with the archetypes.

1364
00:59:18.710 --> 00:59:23.710
And it exerts an irresistible impulse

1365
