1392
01:00:42.020 --> 01:00:43.994
and have the greatest sex they ever had (laughs),

1393
01:00:43.994 --> 01:00:46.590
but there's something to that,

1394
01:00:46.590 --> 01:00:49.910
that it's easier for us these days to kinda

1395
01:00:49.910 --> 01:00:53.030
go around the swamp and we don't even have

1396
01:00:53.030 --> 01:00:56.310
a kind of an aspiration or an ethic to go through the swamp.

1397
01:00:56.310 --> 01:00:58.560
It's not like that's, "Oh, you should do that."

1398
01:00:58.560 --> 01:00:59.640
It's you should avoid that.

1399
01:00:59.640 --> 01:01:00.498
Right, of course.

1400
01:01:00.498 --> 01:01:04.990
All the kind of cultural machinations point

1401
