us towards aspiring to a life of comfort, ease, and luxury.

1402
01:01:09.040 --> 01:01:13.130
And to go back to Maslow's hierarchy of needs,

1403
01:01:13.130 --> 01:01:15.330
if your needs are essentially met,

1404
01:01:15.330 --> 01:01:17.650
