1416
01:01:52.610 --> 01:01:55.840
Where you kind of, you don't have to do that.

1417
01:01:55.840 --> 01:01:58.560
You deliberately choose this adversity,

1418
01:01:58.560 --> 01:02:01.010
this real extreme adversity

1419
01:02:01.010 --> 01:02:03.600
and you deliberately choose to put yourself through that.

1420
01:02:03.600 --> 01:02:05.390
Isn't that kind of what it's about?

1421
01:02:05.390 --> 01:02:06.600
It's kind of a hero's journey?
Well, yeah,

1422
01:02:06.600 --> 01:02:09.096
because we're not living Telamon's life, right?

1423
01:02:09.096 --> 01:02:12.340
We are in this situation where you have

1424
01:02:12.340 --> 01:02:13.754
to craft that for yourself.

1425
01:02:13.754 --> 01:02:15.530
That's why you see
Yeah, artificially.

1426
01:02:15.530 --> 01:02:18.996
Spartan races and Ironman's and all of these things

1427
01:02:18.996 --> 01:02:22.740
because there is something deeply embedded inside of us

1428
01:02:22.740 --> 01:02:25.770
