1472
01:04:33.070 --> 01:04:34.560
I think it was something like that.

1473
01:04:34.560 --> 01:04:36.160
It was really the best part of you,

1474
01:04:36.160 --> 01:04:39.286
the best part of your soul I think calling

1475
01:04:39.286 --> 01:04:42.077
to you and saving your life and leading you

1476
01:04:42.077 --> 01:04:45.980
on this transformational journey that worked,

1477
01:04:45.980 --> 01:04:48.560
