1705
01:14:36.770 --> 01:14:38.293
He's like I get these cards and I have these,

1706
01:14:38.293 --> 01:14:40.232
this is how I do it and then when it's done,

1707
01:14:40.232 --> 01:14:42.280
I put it in this box

1708
01:14:42.280 --> 01:14:46.650
