1713
01:14:58.390 --> 01:14:59.223
Definitely.

1714
01:14:59.223 --> 01:15:00.982
I'm definitely a believer in habits.

1715
01:15:00.982 --> 01:15:04.200
I say that an amateur has amateur habits,

1716
01:15:04.200 --> 01:15:06.005
