1717
01:15:06.005 --> 01:15:07.881
and that's all the difference in the world.

1718
01:15:07.881 --> 01:15:10.283
Did you ever see that documentary,

1719
01:15:11.277 --> 01:15:13.900
"History of the Eagles," about the band, the Eagles?

1720
01:15:13.900 --> 01:15:14.733
No, uh uh.
Ah, well,

1721
01:15:14.733 --> 01:15:17.020
I'm gonna tell you a little story from that.

1722
01:15:17.020 --> 01:15:19.600
This is Glenn Frey was telling this story

