01:15:21.910 --> 01:15:24.070
he roomed with J.D. Souther who was another,

1725
01:15:24.070 --> 01:15:26.880
they were like together and they had an apartment right

1726
01:15:26.880 --> 01:15:28.880
above Jackson Browne's apartment.

1727
01:15:28.880 --> 01:15:29.713
And this is before

1728
01:15:29.713 --> 01:15:30.790
any of them had
Wow.

1729
01:15:30.790 --> 01:15:34.100
had any success at all.

1730
01:15:34.100 --> 01:15:37.210
And he could hear from his apartment above Jackson Browne's,

1731
01:15:37.210 --> 01:15:38.620
he would hear Jackson Browne going

1732
01:15:38.620 --> 01:15:40.600
through playing the piano,

1733
01:15:40.600 --> 01:15:43.980
and he would play like, he was working on a song

1734
01:15:43.980 --> 01:15:47.780
and he would play it one time, play it again, play it again.

1735
01:15:47.780 --> 01:15:50.770
But, and he would stop occasionally to make tea

1736
01:15:50.770 --> 01:15:53.300
and he had like a whistling tea, Jackson Browne would,

1737
01:15:53.300 --> 01:15:55.340
and this was a kind of a punctuation point

1738
01:15:55.340 --> 01:15:57.407
for Glenn Frey listening to this.

1739
01:15:57.407 --> 01:15:59.540
"Oh, there he goes to make another pot of tea,"

1740
01:15:59.540 --> 01:16:00.373
and then he would go back

1741
01:16:00.373 --> 01:16:01.920
and play that same thing again.

1742
01:16:01.920 --> 01:16:03.605
And it just 20 times, 30 times,

1743
01:16:03.605 --> 01:16:05.865
and what Glenn Frey said was,

1744
01:16:05.865 --> 01:16:09.208
"I learned, that's how you write a song."

1745
01:16:09.208 --> 01:16:11.819
It doesn't just come out of the air.

1746
01:16:11.819 --> 01:16:15.330
That Jackson Browne worked that over and over

1747
01:16:15.330 --> 01:16:17.680
until he had it exactly the way he wanted.

1748
01:16:17.680 --> 01:16:20.389
And that it was a grind.

1749
01:16:20.389 --> 01:16:24.740
It was, the daily, one step in front of another.

1750
01:16:24.740 --> 01:16:26.030
And I just thought that was a great story.

1751
01:16:26.030 --> 01:16:26.863
So, true.
Right.

1752
01:16:26.863 --> 01:16:29.310
He wasn't struck by lightning and this perfect song

1753
01:16:29.310 --> 01:16:30.610
