01:17:24.130 --> 01:17:26.430
'cause usually if you're an artist or a writer

1775
01:17:26.430 --> 01:17:28.660
or whatever nobody's giving you any money anyway, right?

1776
01:17:28.660 --> 01:17:31.493
But it's the concept of thinking,

1777
01:17:32.847 --> 01:17:35.600
"If I'm an amateur and I run into adversity,

1778
01:17:35.600 --> 01:17:37.280
I'm gonna fold," right?

1779
01:17:37.280 --> 01:17:38.790
Because I'm not really in it.

1780
01:17:38.790 --> 01:17:40.520
I'm just doin' it for fun, right?

1781
01:17:40.520 --> 01:17:44.578
Or if I'm not in the mood, I'm not gonna work today.

1782
01:17:44.578 --> 01:17:47.656
Or if I've got problems with the family

1783
01:17:47.656 --> 01:17:51.390
or whatever, money, I'm gonna blow off today's work

1784
01:17:51.390 --> 01:17:53.020
or today's workout or whatever,

1785
01:17:53.020 --> 01:17:55.740
